        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$saferoom_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The morning breeze pours down from the cliff top, ripping white mist into shreds of shadow. BM wakes up early, and quietly gets up without waking Muriel, all curled up next to her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She follows the path they marked yesterday, her fingers touching the cold, rough rock patterns as her shoes kick up pebbles with dull thuds."
    },
    {
        "text": "She does not know what she is looking for."
    },
    {
        "text": "She only has a hunch\u2014there was an abnormal light reflection in the warm-gray rock strata they were recording specimens from yesterday."
    },
    {
        "text": "Day breaks."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_wilderness_m",
        "screenadapt": "showall",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowfootstep",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "BM is back at that spot."
    },
    {
        "text": "She stands before the cliff as the sun rises, and bends down, parting the plants growing within the cracks in the rock, scraping loose soil away. Golden morning light happens to hit the mountain pass just in time, and lights up the exposed rock face."
    },
    {
        "text": "At that very moment, tiny sparkles bloom from the ash-gray layer, as if tiny stars are growing within."
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Basalt_Moon'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the rare ore Muriel mentioned we might find here? Hah, it's not a rare ore, no, but apatite we've come across before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Basalt_Moon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "In truth, Muriel had woken up even earlier, and quietly trailed BM with her tool bag up the mountain. She stands at a distance away, watching BM's back, excitement along with a tinge of pity in her eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "BM does not notice Muriel behind her, with her gaze focused on following the morning light as it swims within the rock texture, as if trying to find something deeper past the rock's composition."
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Basalt_Moon'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why does the sunlight make it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Basalt_Moon'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "BM is silent for a moment. She then kneels down, and reaches out to gently rub the apatite shard."
    },
    {
        "text": "The sun shines down on her shoulders, the morning light slowly adding new tints to the crystal layer. Blue and green lights dance as if gently responding to her coming closer."
    },
    {
        "text": "BM is momentarily stunned."
    },
    {
        "text": "The next second, her shoulders shake."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her elbows and back follow suit. Tears fall almost too suddenly, wetting the rock face and the back of her hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Muriel stays still, taking in the silent yet sharp sobs from BM before her. Behind her the breeze sweeps through the mountain valley, and a fowlbeast flies past the precipice as the entire mountainside is bathed in sunlight."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
